@startuml
title Durable run and terminal reply — causal sequence
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor Author #FFD8C2
participant F1r3sky #D5EAF7
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8
participant "RSpace team env" as Env #CDEACC
participant "Compiled team" as Team #FFE4A6
participant "Agent/effect" as Effect #DDD2F2
participant "Run inspector" as Inspector #D5EAF7

Author -> F1r3sky : post @team prompt
F1r3sky -> API : prepareRun(prompt, replyRef)
API --> F1r3sky : signed contract + UUIDv7 run capability
F1r3sky -> API : send(signed contract)
API -> Env : beginRun(runId, team, createdAt, ack)
Env -> Env : commit runStarted metadata
Env --> API : ack
API -> Team : invoke(prompt)
Team -> Effect : activity(value, return)
Effect --> Team : result
Team --> API : terminal value
API -> Env : finishRun(runId, ack)
Env -> Env : commit runReturned
Env --> API : ack
API -> F1r3sky : reply truncated to 280 chars\n+ /runs/{runId}
Author -> Inspector : open run URL
Inspector -> API : GET /runs/{runId}
API -> Env : getRun(runId)
Env --> API : metadata-only event ledger
API --> Inspector : status + event types

note over API,Env #FFF0C7
The two acknowledgements establish\nrunStarted < work < runReturned < post.
end note
@enduml
